---
title: Kokio user journey, contract calls (Base, EntryPoint v0.8)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Kokio app + kokio-sdk
    participant BFF as Kokio BFF (admin key)
    participant Bundler as Pimlico bundler + paymaster
    participant EP as EntryPoint v0.8
    participant DWF as DeviceWalletFactory
    participant DW as DeviceWallet
    participant Reg as Registry
    participant EW as ESIMWallet
    participant PA as PaymentAdapter
    participant Vault as Vault Safe

    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    Note over User,Reg: Onboarding
    User->>App: Create passkey (P256 key stays in the secure enclave)
    App->>App: getSmartWallet (counterfactual address)
    alt Backend deploys
        BFF->>DWF: createAccount(deviceId, ownerKey, salt)
        DWF->>DW: deploy BeaconProxy at the CREATE2 address
    else First user operation deploys
        App->>Bundler: sponsored user operation with initCode
        Bundler->>EP: handleOps
        EP->>DWF: createAccount (through SenderCreator)
    end
    BFF->>DWF: postCreateAccount(wallet, deviceId, ownerKey, salt)
    DWF->>Reg: register device wallet and owner key
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 242)
    Note over User,EW: eSIM wallet
    BFF->>DW: deployESIMWallet(salt)
    DW->>EW: ESIMWalletFactory deploys it, owned by DW
    Note right of EW: starts with the registry's default<br/>admin allowance (USD 25)
    Note over App,EW: or the user does it: deployAndBindESIMWallet in one user operation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    Note over User,Vault: Purchase from the device wallet
    App->>BFF: create order (device wallet rail)
    BFF->>App: ordered calls to sign (SDK buyDataBundleWithTransfer)
    User->>App: approve with Face ID (passkey signs the user operation)
    App->>Bundler: sponsored user operation
    Bundler->>EP: handleOps
    EP->>DW: validateUserOp (P256Verifier checks the passkey), then executeBatch
    DW->>EW: token.transfer(amount still needed)
    DW->>EW: buyDataBundleWithToken(bundle, asset, maxAmountIn, paymentReference)
    EW->>Reg: requireNotPaused, price cap, consume payment reference
    EW->>PA: quote(asset, priceUSDCents), transfer tokens, settle
    PA->>Vault: spent tokens
    PA-->>EW: refund any excess
    EW-->>BFF: DataBundleBoughtWithToken event (Alchemy webhook)
    BFF->>BFF: verify payment, provision the eSIM
    BFF->>Reg: assignESIMIdentifier(eSIMWallet, eSIMId)
    Reg->>EW: setESIMUniqueIdentifier
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 252)
    Note over BFF,EW: Paid outside the protocol (card, coupon, external wallet)
    BFF->>Reg: recordSettledPurchase(eSIMWallet, bundle, asset, amount, paymentReference)
    Reg->>EW: add to purchase history (no tokens move)
    end
